{
  "slug": "thermocouple",
  "title": "Thermocouple Tables",
  "description": "Thermocouple millivolt tables and a temperature/mV converter with cold-junction compensation. Types J, K, T, E, N, R, S, B, ITS-90, reference junction 0 °C. Verified against NIST.",
  "lead": [
    "Eight letter types, ITS-90, reference junction at 0 °C. Convert temperature to millivolts and back with cold-junction compensation, or generate a reference table at any interval. Built straight from the NIST reference functions."
  ],
  "sections": [
