      "question": "Thermocouple type",
      "body": "<div class=\"pg-seg\" id=\"typeSeg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Type\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"J\">J</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"K\" class=\"is-on\">K</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"T\">T</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"E\">E</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"N\">N</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"R\">R</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"S\">S</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-t=\"B\">B</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"pg-tool__sub\" id=\"typeInfo\" style=\"margin-top:14px;margin-bottom:0\"></p>\n      <div class=\"pg-verify\" id=\"selfTest\" aria-label=\"Self test against NIST anchors\"></div>",
      "text": "J K T E N R S B"
    },
    {
      "id": "",
      "question": "Convert",
      "body": "<div class=\"pg-seg pg-seg--block\" id=\"modeSeg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Direction\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-m=\"c2mv\" class=\"is-on\">Temperature → mV</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-m=\"mv2c\">mV → Temperature</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pg-grid pg-grid--2\">\n        <div class=\"pg-field\">\n          <label class=\"pg-field__label\" id=\"inLabel\" for=\"hotIn\">Hot junction <span class=\"u\">(°C)</span></label>\n          <div class=\"pg-inwrap\"><input class=\"pg-num\" id=\"hotIn\" value=\"300\"><button class=\"pg-sign\" type=\"button\" data-sign=\"#hotIn\">±</button></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pg-field\">\n          <label class=\"pg-field__label\" for=\"cjcIn\">Cold junction / reference <span class=\"u\">(°C)</span></label>\n          <div class=\"pg-inwrap\"><input class=\"pg-num\" id=\"cjcIn\" value=\"25\"><button class=\"pg-sign\" type=\"button\" data-sign=\"#cjcIn\">±</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"pg-rule\">\n      <div class=\"pg-readouts\">\n        <div class=\"pg-readout\">\n          <div class=\"pg-readout__k\" id=\"outK\">Meter reads</div>\n          <div class=\"pg-out is-good\" id=\"outMain\"><span>—</span><span class=\"pg-out__u\" id=\"outU\">mV</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pg-readout\">\n          <div class=\"pg-readout__k\">E(hot), ref 0 °C</div>\n          <div class=\"pg-out\" style=\"font-size:1.3rem\" id=\"outEhot\"><span>—</span><span class=\"pg-out__u\">mV</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pg-readout\">\n          <div class=\"pg-readout__k\">E(cold junction)</div>\n          <div class=\"pg-out\" style=\"font-size:1.3rem\" id=\"outEcjc\"><span>—</span><span class=\"pg-out__u\">mV</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"pg-tablenote\" id=\"convNote\"></p>",
      "text": "Temperature → mV mV → Temperature Hot junction (°C) ± Cold junction / reference (°C) ± Meter reads —mV E(hot), ref 0 °C —mV E(cold junction) —mV"
    },
